# --- E2 evaluation contract: DEFINITIONS ONLY are version-controlled ---
# artifacts/ is ignored above because it holds results and large files. The E2 contract is not a result:
# it is the frozen measurement definition that future experiments must import, so exactly these five
# definitional JSON files are tracked. Every E2 validation RESULT stays ignored.
!artifacts/e2_evaluation_contract/
artifacts/e2_evaluation_contract/*
!artifacts/e2_evaluation_contract/contract_v1.json
!artifacts/e2_evaluation_contract/metric_taxonomy.json
!artifacts/e2_evaluation_contract/matching_contract.json
!artifacts/e2_evaluation_contract/aggregation_contract.json
!artifacts/e2_evaluation_contract/coverage_contract.json
